{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"At the park, Sora sees a new child drawing in the sand.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.22,0.29],[0.36,0.85],[0.91,1.25],[1.31,1.54],[1.6,1.63],[1.71,1.9],[1.97,2.32],[2.38,2.75],[2.82,2.91],[2.96,3.03],[3.1,3.95]]},{"text":"Sora walks over and says, Hi, I am Sora. Want to build roads together?","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.77],[0.84,1.07],[1.13,1.24],[1.32,1.82],[2.15,2.47],[2.55,2.61],[2.71,2.82],[2.91,3.44],[3.68,3.92],[3.97,4.02],[4.09,4.34],[4.42,4.75],[4.81,5.71]]},{"text":"The new child, Ben, smiles and says yes.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.24,0.41],[0.48,0.84],[0.88,1.2],[1.22,1.72],[1.78,1.89],[1.95,2.19],[2.26,2.97]]},{"text":"They discover both like toy trucks and bridges.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.85],[0.93,1.18],[1.24,1.45],[1.52,1.8],[1.86,2.23],[2.28,2.37],[2.45,3.44]]},{"text":"Soon they make a whole sand city with tunnels and ramps.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.4,0.56],[0.64,0.89],[0.94,0.99],[1.07,1.39],[1.46,1.81],[1.88,2.17],[2.23,2.4],[2.47,2.94],[2.98,3.1],[3.19,3.95]]},{"text":"When Ben wants a quiet minute, Sora gives him space.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.34,0.59],[0.66,0.94],[0.99,1.01],[1.09,1.46],[1.53,1.89],[1.94,2.24],[2.3,2.52],[2.57,2.71],[2.77,3.67]]},{"text":"After resting, Ben joins again and thanks Sora for waiting.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.42,1.02],[1.09,1.36],[1.44,1.78],[1.83,2.17],[2.25,2.42],[2.5,2.86],[2.88,3.22],[3.27,3.44],[3.52,4.37]]},{"text":"They cheer each other when a tower stands tall.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.37,0.7],[0.78,0.99],[1.06,1.26],[1.33,1.52],[1.58,1.63],[1.7,2.07],[2.14,2.53],[2.61,3.34]]},{"text":"By sunset, they plan to meet again next weekend.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.3,0.99],[1.04,1.24],[1.31,1.56],[1.64,1.68],[1.74,1.96],[2.02,2.32],[2.39,2.66],[2.72,3.67]]},{"text":"Sora learns friendship grows from hello, kindness, and respect.","words":[[0,0.42],[0.49,0.92],[1.02,1.54],[1.61,1.99],[2.06,2.25],[2.33,3.01],[3.22,4],[4.08,4.26],[4.34,5.34]]}]}